WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.270
The audience questions have been pouring in
sort of like a firehose and maybe not surprisingly,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.640
as we get closer to the November election,
more and more of the questions relate to the

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.640
election.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.640
But not all of them.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.360
The first one I got is how much of America
will refuse the Corona virus vaccine?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.029
And will this prevent us from getting to herd
immunity?

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:20.089
This is it's really an empirical question.

00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:24.150
It's not mean we can speculate about motives
and we can look at polling to figure out part

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.150
of the answer.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:29.859
But part of this is an empirical question
in terms of will we get to that magic number

00:00:29.859 --> 00:00:33.530
that we need in order to reach herd immunity?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.750
Now, herd immunity, there's a little bit of
confusion about herd immunity.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:44.780
There are folks who e-mail me and I can tell
that they don't realize the level of immunity

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.340
to reach herd immunity depends on the disease.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:54.570
So if a disease is much more contagious, like,
for example, measles, which has an R value

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.429
of somewhere between 16 and 18, I'm going
from memory here.

00:00:59.429 --> 00:01:05.829
Measles is so contagious, it spreads so easily
where it can be aerosolized, where you go

00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:11.110
into an elevator after someone has already
left the elevator and they might have been

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.591
carrying it and you could catch it.

00:01:12.591 --> 00:01:16.560
It's a it's a huge level of contagion, far
more than corona virus or the flu.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:20.320
It's so contagious that you need like 95 percent
of immunity to reach herd immunity, which

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:25.200
is why it's so important that everybody be
vaccinated against measles when the condition

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:31.310
is less contagious, when the disease is less
contagious, like corona virus, which is more

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:34.640
contagious than flu, but far less contagious
than measles.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:40.040
The level of immunity required for herd immunity
is lower, and the estimates are that for coronavirus

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:45.810
it's about 70 percent rather than measles
is 95 because corona virus spreads less easily

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:47.030
than measles.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.759
So we need to get to 70 percent.

00:01:48.759 --> 00:01:53.100
Now, you can get to that through a combination
of naturally acquired immunity from people

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:58.920
who have recovered from the disease and immunizations,
people who have been vaccinated.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:07.070
Now, there's an open question as to how long
you are immune after recovering from coronavirus.

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:08.780
We don't know the answer to that yet.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.959
But hypothetically, you could get your 70
percent.

00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:19.360
A five percent of the population has recovered
naturally from Corona virus and two thirds,

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.420
66 percent get vaccinated.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.060
That gets you 71 percent.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.920
You are at herd immunity.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:31.120
The sad reality of the situation is that we
have two poles, one from right around June

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.170
one and one from July one, roughly where only
about half of Americans say they plan to get

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.500
the vaccine.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:45.190
There's an AP NORC poll from May 27 where
50 percent of Americans say they would get

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.180
a corona virus vaccine.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:53.060
And then June 30th on different poll, which
says that, again, about 50 percent of Americans

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.409
plan to get the vaccine.

00:02:54.409 --> 00:02:57.950
Now, it's been five weeks since that latest
poll.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:01.049
It's conceivable that because of the continued
spread.

00:03:01.049 --> 00:03:05.250
Deaths back up to 50, you know, a thousand
twelve hundred fifteen hundred a day that

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.080
more people are now planning to get the vaccine.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.510
Now, this is simple math.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:15.540
If you need 70 and half plan to get the vaccine
to get to herd immunity, that means you need

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.019
an additional 20 percent of the country to
recover.

00:03:19.019 --> 00:03:23.870
Naturally, 20 percent of the country is about
66 million people.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:33.769
That would imply a 660000 person death toll,
estimating roughly one percent of those who

00:03:33.769 --> 00:03:35.370
get the virus die.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.640
Now, that's the simple math.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:47.180
The reality is when you look at more complex
and detailed contagion models, you don't literally

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:50.400
need 70 percent in for this reason.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.250
And I want to try to explain this correctly.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.480
You are right.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.720
You don't come into contact with everybody
in the country.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:08.239
So in reality, your risk of contagion is not
so much about is the country level or at a

00:04:08.239 --> 00:04:11.430
country level, do we have 70 percent immunity?

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.849
But it's more related to what's going on in
your immediate surroundings.

00:04:14.849 --> 00:04:20.040
And because we have dramatically different
urban versus rural or rural, as Trump says,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:25.760
situations in the United States, you probably
would get up a practical, practically speaking,

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:31.540
herd immunity somewhere short of 70 percent,
because not the entire population is not regularly

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.610
coming into contact with the entire population.

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:37.530
You're mostly coming into contact with some
limited group of people when you're going

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:39.480
to work, when you're going to your grocery
store, et cetera.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:42.530
And so there are the real number is a little
short of 70 percent.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:47.830
But regardless if only half the country plans
to get the vaccine, we need 20 percent to

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.910
get the virus in order to reach herd immunity.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.040
And that means a lot of people are going to
die.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:55.570
That would be another 500000 people compared
to where we are right now.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.050
Very, very ugly.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.420
I hope that it's not the case.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.560
I hope people change.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.560
Their minds.

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.800
But the polling so far is extremely disturbing

